# PROJECT DEPENDENCIES 

The project depends on:

## Leadership Approval
The project requires executive approval before implementation.

## Clinical Engagement
Healthcare professionals must participate in requirements gathering and testing.

## Technology Integration
Existing hospital systems must support integration.

## Supplier Availability

Technology suppliers must deliver required services within agreed timelines.

## Staff Availability
Clinical teams must have time available for training and testing.


# PLANNING ASSUMPTIONS 

The project assumes:
- Funding remains available.
- Stakeholders remain engaged.
- Required technology can be implemented.
- Staff training can be completed.
- Existing systems can support integration.


# PLANNING CONSTRAINTS

The project constraints include:
- Healthcare operational pressures
- Limited staff availability
- Regulatory requirements
- Budget limitations
- Patient safety requirements


